;---------------------------------------------------
;
; measuring block information
;
;---------------------------------------------------
;
;
001,1,Voltage Supply,(Terminal 15)
001,2,Light Switch,Status,Display Range:\n\n 1 = ON\n 2 = OFF
001,3,Vehicle Speed
001,4,Acceleration
;
002,1,Voltage level,sensor front,0 Volt  => level sensor faulty\n+5 volts => wiring faulty
002,2,Voltage level,sensor rear,0 Volt  => level sensor faulty\n+5 volts => wiring faulty
002,3,Actuator Motor,Activation
002,4,Time Constant
;
;
;---------------------------------------------------
;
; coding information
;
;---------------------------------------------------
;
;
C00,Dynamic Headlight Aim Control (J431) Coding
C01,00001 - Audi A8 (4D - Facelift)
C02,00005 - Skoda Superb (3U) FWD
C03,00006 - Skoda Superb (3U) AWD
C04,00007 - VW Passat (3B) FWD
C05,00008 - VW Passat (3B) AWD
C06,00020 - Audi A6 V8 (4B)
C07,00030 - Audi A6 Allroad (4B)
C08,00040 - Audi A6 FWD (4B - Facelift)
C09,00050 - Audi A6 Quattro (4B - Facelift)
C10,00060 - Audi A4 (8E)
C11,00070 - Audi A4 Cabrio/Coupé (8E)
